---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SEOHead from '../components/SEOHead.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <SEOHead
    slot="head"
    title="Resume | Jacob Steelsmith"
    description="Resume of Jacob Steelsmith — Staff/Principal Engineer with 20+ years of experience in AI systems, cloud architecture, distributed systems, and engineering leadership."
  />

  <h1>Resume</h1>
  <br />
  <section class="resume-section" aria-labelledby="summary-heading">
    <h2 id="summary-heading">Professional Summary</h2>
    <p>Hands-on technology and engineering leader with 15+ years of experience modernizing platforms, scaling cloud infrastructure, and leading high-impact engineering initiatives in resource-constrained environments. Proven track record transforming legacy monoliths and on-premise systems into cloud-native, serverless, and distributed architectures on AWS. Deep expertise across backend systems, platform engineering, DevOps, infrastructure, real-time streaming systems, and AI-assisted development workflows.</p>
    <p>Built and led the evolution of engineering and IT capabilities at a growing organization supporting thousands of public safety candidates nationwide, delivering mission-critical systems with high availability, scalability, and security requirements. Led initiatives spanning serverless application platforms, real-time virtual testing and proctoring systems, cloud-native data platforms, CI/CD modernization, observability, identity modernization, and enterprise infrastructure transformation.</p>
    <p>Strong background in AWS, Python, distributed systems, serverless architecture, event-driven design, platform reliability, and operational scalability. Experienced building systems with Lambda, API Gateway, Cognito, RDS, S3, EKS, Kinesis, Redshift, Glue, CloudFormation, and modern frontend frameworks including React. Early adopter of AI-assisted engineering workflows, agentic AI tooling, RAG systems, and structured knowledge pipelines to improve engineering velocity, operational insight, and software quality.</p>
    <p>Known for operating effectively in ambiguous, high-pressure environments, aligning technology strategy with business outcomes, and remaining deeply hands-on technically while leading teams and modernization efforts. Combines strategic leadership with practical engineering execution, strong cross-functional collaboration, and a builder mindset focused on delivering scalable, maintainable systems that solve real operational problems and create value.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="resume-section" aria-labelledby="skills-heading">
    <h2 id="skills-heading">Skills</h2>

    <h3>Languages</h3>
    <ul class="skill-list">
      <li>JavaScript</li>
      <li>Bash</li>
      <li>Python</li>
      <li>SQL</li>
      <li>CFML</li>
      <li>PHP</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>AI &amp; Automation</h3>
    <ul class="skill-list">
      <li>AI Assisted Engineering Workflows</li>
      <li>MCP Servers</li>
      <li>RAG (Amazon Bedrock)</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Backend &amp; APIs</h3>
    <ul class="skill-list">
      <li>REST APIs</li>
      <li>Backend services</li>
      <li>Data modeling</li>
      <li>Transactional systems</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Frontend</h3>
    <ul class="skill-list">
      <li>React</li>
      <li>Modern JavaScript frameworks</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Cloud &amp; Infrastructure</h3>
    <ul class="skill-list">
      <li>AWS Lambda</li>
      <li>API Gateway</li>
      <li>Cognito</li>
      <li>RDS</li>
      <li>S3</li>
      <li>CloudWatch</li>
      <li>CloudFormation</li>
      <li>Glue</li>
      <li>Redshift</li>
      <li>EKS</li>
      <li>Kinesis</li>
      <li>Amplify</li>
      <li>Serverless architecture</li>
      <li>Kubernetes</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Systems</h3>
    <ul class="skill-list">
      <li>Distributed systems</li>
      <li>Event-driven architecture</li>
      <li>Real-time streaming</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Databases</h3>
    <ul class="skill-list">
      <li>MySQL</li>
      <li>SQL Server</li>
      <li>DynamoDB</li>
      <li>Redshift</li>
      <li>Schema design</li>
      <li>DBMS management</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Tools</h3>
    <ul class="skill-list">
      <li>Git</li>
      <li>CI/CD pipelines</li>
      <li>Playwright</li>
      <li>pytest</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Leadership</h3>
    <ul class="skill-list">
      <li>Hiring</li>
      <li>Mentoring</li>
      <li>Performance management</li>
      <li>Delivery ownership</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="resume-section" aria-labelledby="experience-heading">
    <h2 id="experience-heading">Work Experience</h2>

    <article class="experience-item">
      <h3>Director of Information Technology (Engineering &amp; Cloud)</h3>
      <p class="experience-meta">
        <span class="company">National Testing Network</span>
        <span class="separator" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
        <time datetime="2015-09">Sep 2015</time> &ndash; Present
      </p>
      <ul class="experience-details">
        <li>Led architecture, modernization, and operation of a customer-facing SaaS platform serving thousands of public safety candidates and organizations annually</li>
        <li>Built and led engineering teams of up to 7 members, including hiring, mentoring, technical leadership, and development process modernization</li>
        <li>Directed migration from a monolithic ColdFusion application to a cloud-native AWS architecture using serverless services, APIs, Python, and React, improving deployment efficiency by ~40%</li>
        <li>Designed and operated distributed production systems focused on scalability, reliability, observability, and operational resilience</li>
        <li>Implemented serverless architectures using AWS Lambda, API Gateway, Cognito, and event-driven workflows to improve scalability and reduce operational overhead</li>
        <li>Built a remote proctoring platform in ~3 weeks using AWS Kinesis Video Streams, replacing a $50K third-party vendor solution and enabling uninterrupted operations during COVID disruptions</li>
        <li>Designed and implemented a real-time video platform using LiveKit, Kubernetes (EKS), and Helm to support streaming and recording workflows</li>
        <li>Built a middleware proxy enabling standard MySQL clients to connect to AWS RDS Data API, simplifying developer workflows and enabling serverless database access patterns</li>
        <li>Implemented CI/CD pipelines, automated testing, and deployment workflows using GitHub Actions, Playwright, and pytest to improve release reliability and reduce regression risk</li>
        <li>Introduced AI-assisted engineering workflows using agentic AI tooling, MCP servers, and automated development pipelines to improve engineering productivity and accelerate delivery</li>
        <li>Partnered with executive leadership on platform strategy, budgeting, security, operational planning, and technology roadmap decisions</li>
        <li>Owned production availability, incident response, performance optimization, and operational support for business-critical systems</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="experience-item">
      <h3>Senior Web Developer</h3>
      <p class="experience-meta">
        <span class="company">National Testing Network</span>
        <span class="separator" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
        <time datetime="2013">2013</time> &ndash; <time datetime="2015">2015</time>
      </p>
      <ul class="experience-details">
        <li>Developed and maintained high-traffic web applications supporting public safety testing and licensing workflows for tens of thousands of users</li>
        <li>Led migration from a single-server hosting environment to AWS using Lucee on Elastic Beanstalk and Amazon RDS, improving uptime by ~80% and performance by ~60%</li>
        <li>Designed and developed full-stack applications, backend services, APIs, and database-driven systems</li>
        <li>Standardized development workflows and introduced reusable frameworks and engineering practices that improved development speed by ~25%</li>
        <li>Contributed to infrastructure modernization, scalability improvements, and operational automation initiatives</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="experience-item">
      <h3>Software Developer</h3>
      <p class="experience-meta">
        <span class="company">Everett Community College</span>
        <span class="separator" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
        <time datetime="2005">2005</time> &ndash; <time datetime="2013">2013</time>
      </p>
      <ul class="experience-details">
        <li>Developed and maintained full-stack web applications and backend systems supporting academic, administrative, and student service workflows</li>
        <li>Built database-driven applications using CFML, SQL Server, and JavaScript with a focus on maintainability, usability, and performance</li>
        <li>Participated in modernization initiatives involving identity management, content management systems, and distributed campus services</li>
        <li>Helped improve software delivery practices through source control standardization and development process improvements</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="experience-item">
      <h3>Instructor &mdash; Database Design (Part-Time)</h3>
      <p class="experience-meta">
        <span class="company">Everett Community College</span>
      </p>
      <ul class="experience-details">
        <li>Taught database design, relational modeling, and SQL fundamentals across multiple academic quarters</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="resume-section" aria-labelledby="education-heading">
    <h2 id="education-heading">Education</h2>
    <p><strong>B.S. Cloud and Network Engineering</strong> &mdash; Western Governors University (Expected June 2026)</p>
  </section>

  <section class="resume-section" aria-labelledby="certifications-heading">
    <h2 id="certifications-heading">Certifications</h2>
    <ul class="certification-list">
      <li><strong>AWS Certified SysOps Administrator – Associate</strong><span class="cert-date">2025</span></li>
      <li><strong>AWS Certified Developer – Associate</strong><span class="cert-date">2025</span></li>
      <li><strong>ITIL Foundation</strong><span class="cert-date">2024</span></li>
      <li><strong>CompTIA Security+</strong><span class="cert-date">2024</span></li>
      <li><strong>CompTIA Cloud+</strong><span class="cert-date">2023</span></li>
      <li><strong>AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner</strong><span class="cert-date">2023</span></li>
      <li><strong>CompTIA Project+</strong><span class="cert-date">2023</span></li>
      <li><strong>CompTIA Network+</strong><span class="cert-date">2023</span></li>
      <li><strong>Linux Essentials (LPI)</strong><span class="cert-date">2022</span></li>
      <li><strong>CompTIA A+</strong><span class="cert-date">2022</span></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .resume-section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .resume-section h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .resume-section p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .resume-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .resume-section h3 {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .skill-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .skill-list li {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-alt);
    padding: var(--space-xs) var(--space-md);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .experience-item {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .experience-item h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .experience-meta {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .experience-meta .company {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .experience-meta .separator {
    margin-inline: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .experience-details {
    padding-left: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .experience-details li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    max-width: var(--content-max-width);
  }

  .certification-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .certification-list li {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: var(--space-sm) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .certification-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .cert-date {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-left: var(--space-md);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .skill-list {
      gap: var(--space-xs);
    }
  }
</style>
